quation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q_{68}(\\Omega,W):=\\{[X]_{\\Omega,W}:X\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q_{68}(\\Omega,W):=\\{[X]_{\\Omega,W}:X\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mu_{\\Omega,W}:=\\{(([X]_{\\Omega,W},[Y]_{\\Omega,W}),[X\\,^\\frown Y]_{\\Omega,W}):X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mu_{\\Omega,W}:=\\{(([X]_{\\Omega,W},[Y]_{\\Omega,W}),[X\\,^\\frown Y]_{\\Omega,W}):X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"e_{\\Omega,W}:=[\\epsilon_{68}]_{\\Omega,W},\\qquad \\iota_{\\Omega,W}:=\\{(a,[\\langle a\\rangle]_{\\Omega,W}):a\\in\\Omega\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[e_{\\Omega,W}:=[\\epsilon_{68}]_{\\Omega,W},\\qquad \\iota_{\\Omega,W}:=\\{(a,[\\langle a\\rangle]_{\\Omega,W}):a\\in\\Omega\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M_{68}(\\Omega,W):=(Q_{68}(\\Omega,W),\\mu_{\\Omega,W},e_{\\Omega,W},\\iota_{\\Omega,W}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M_{68}(\\Omega,W):=(Q_{68}(\\Omega,W),\\mu_{\\Omega,W},e_{\\Omega,W},\\iota_{\\Omega,W}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §10，印刷 p.32 / PDF p.41 的 X*、S、乘法及字母解释。在对称性前提下，可达等价类构成集合 Q；合同性说明若 [X]=[X′] 且 [Y]=[Y′]，则 [X⌢Y]=[X′⌢Y′]，故显式 μ 图是 Q²→Q 的全函数。词连接结合律降到商上，空词类给单位元。已核对源证明及代表元无关性；此构造不以挑选代表元为定义，所以无选择函数缺口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-word-process-reachability","status":"resolved","id":"833504bc40d11acb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-word-process-reachability]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-symmetric-word-process","status":"resolved","id":"b4a73e7703406240","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-symmetric-word-process]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-symmetric-reachability-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"a757ce838695243e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-thm-symmetric-reachability-congruence]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-shoenfield-semigroup","status":"resolved","id":"b2a2b4650e47dbfa","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-shoenfield-semigroup]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-symmetric-word-process","status":"resolved","id":"b4a73e7703406240","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SymProcess}_{68}(\\Omega,W)$，见 [[68-df-symmetric-word-process]]。词与可达性见 [[68-df-word-process-reachability]]；合同性见 [[68-thm-symmetric-reachability-congruence]]。四元组结构与词求值取 [[68-df-shoenfield-semigroup]] 的接口。$X\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)$。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-word-process-reachability","status":"resolved","id":"833504bc40d11acb","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SymProcess}_{68}(\\Omega,W)$，见 [[68-df-symmetric-word-process]]。词与可达性见 [[68-df-word-process-reachability]]；合同性见 [[68-thm-symmetric-reachability-congruence]]。四元组结构与词求值取 [[68-df-shoenfield-sem